                Create clean, professional invoices tailored for sole traders, freelancers, and self-employed professionals. Add your business details, services, hourly rates or fixed fees, taxes, and download as PDF. No accounting knowledge required – just fill, click, and bill.
            </p>

            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-4">
                <a href="https://ratpdf.com/Invoice/Create" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg px-4">
                    Create Sole Trader Invoice
                </a>

                <a href="#features" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg px-4">
                    Explore Features
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="row g-3 mt-3">
                <div class="col-md-4">
                    <div class="border rounded p-3 text-center h-100">
