                <div class="bg-primary text-white rounded-4 p-5 shadow-lg">
                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-4">Ready to Invoice Your Next Client?</h3>
                    <p class="mb-4">
                        Create a professional invoice in under a minute – no learning curve, no cost.
                    </p>
